        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Paris, present day, in a typical bistro. A disillusioned young woman meets a charismatic man. They embark on a spontaneous and unconventional date, filled with lightness, destructive therapy, and deep conversations. As they explore the city together, they discover a connection that transcends norms and social expectations, challenging the meaning of love and relationships in the modern world.",
